---------------------------Linux Directory Structure---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                                                                                                                                            |
|  # Linux has one main root directory, represented by: /                                                                                                    |
|                                                                                                                                                            |
|    Everything starts from /.                                                                                                                               |
|    A simplified structure: Some Key Structure                                                                                                              |
|                     /                                                                                                                                      |
|                      ├── bin   (accessable to all users) contains important binariies file for bootup,programs and to run commands like cd, ls, pwd etc    |
|                      ├── boot  Files needed for booting                                                                                                    | 
|                      ├── dev   Device files                                                                                                                | 
|                      ├── etc   System/application configuration                                                                                            |
|                      ├── home  Normal users' home directories                                                                                              |
|                      ├── opt   Optional/third-party software, executables                                                                                  |
|                      ├── proc  Information about running processes/kernel                                                                                  |  
|                      ├── root  Root user's home directory                                                                                                  |
|                      ├── sbin  Many system administration commands                                                                                         |
|                      ├── sys  Kernel/device information                                                                                                    |  
|                      ├── tmp   Temporary files                                                                                                             |
|                      └── var   contains variable data such as logs of sys and application                                                                  |
|                                                                                                                                                            |
|                                                                                                                                                            |
